  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-rea-kit · REA 逆向方法论",
      "text": "Methodology + environment-check layer inspired by [morluto/rea](https://github.com/morluto/rea) (Reverse Engineer Anything, 400k★). This is **not** a decompiler — it mounts the *discipline* and generates toolchain plans."
    },
    {
      "section": "五步循环",
      "text": "观察行为（黑盒抓包/strace）→ 定位入口（按类型选刀）→ 静态分析（符号/字符串/模块地图）→ 动态验证（hook假设）→ 文档结晶（已证/待证/下一步三段笔记）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "工具 `rea_plan`",
      "text": "按目标类型（apk/native/electron/web/ctf）输出工具链四件套 + 本机环境体检（jadx/ghidra/frida/objdump…在不在）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "⚠️ 授权硬门",
      "text": "仅限分析你拥有、获授权或明确允许逆向的目标（自有应用/CTF/互操作/安全审计合同范围）。不确定=先问，不问=不做。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```\ndsh plugin add github:xushilianzhuren/dsh-rea-kit\n```\nMIT License."
    }
  ],
